{"id":"5c5d5e9dd48a36f0","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dim-oracle-lower.md","title":"相对化不增加有效维数","display":"thm-dim-oracle-lower — 相对化不增加有效维数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dim-oracle-lower","aliases":["43-thm-dim-oracle-lower"],"display":"thm-dim-oracle-lower — 相对化不增加有效维数","depends_on":["[[43-df-reldim]]","[[43-df-effhausdim]]","[[43-df-effpackdim]]","[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Thm.17.3.2 and Cor.17.6.12 relativized","verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dim-oracle-lower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dim-oracle-lower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dim-oracle-lower — 相对化不增加有效维数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc5e1d2950e8a1f7\" href=\"?note=bc5e1d2950e8a1f7\" title=\"43-df-reldim\">43-df-reldim</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28c411f76cbe3176\" href=\"?note=28c411f76cbe3176\" title=\"43-df-effpackdim\">43-df-effpackdim</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thm.17.3.2 and Cor.17.6.12 relativized"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bc5e1d2950e8a1f7\" href=\"?note=bc5e1d2950e8a1f7\" title=\"43-df-reldim\">43-df-reldim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28c411f76cbe3176\" href=\"?note=28c411f76cbe3176\" title=\"43-df-effpackdim\">43-df-effpackdim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\dim_H^A(X)\\le\\dim_H(X)\\land\\mathrm{Dim}^A(X)\\le\\mathrm{Dim}(X).\n\\qquad\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A(X)\\Rightarrow\\dim_H^A(X)=\\dim_H(X)=\\mathrm{Dim}^A(X)=\\mathrm{Dim}(X)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\dim_H^A(X)\\le\\dim_H(X)\\land\\mathrm{Dim}^A(X)\\le\\mathrm{Dim}(X).\n\\qquad\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A(X)\\Rightarrow\\dim_H^A(X)=\\dim_H(X)=\\mathrm{Dim}^A(X)=\\mathrm{Dim}(X)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：K^A(σ)≤K(σ)+O(1)；相对 Levin–Schnorr 下界 K^A(X↾n)≥n−O(1) 与通用上界夹逼。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"link